  <div class="modal-box">
    <h3>Add Event Result</h3>
    <div class="sub">The big screen and the table view update instantly. For <b>Individual</b> games, enter the student name — it will appear with the house tag in the table. For Team / Grouped games, the name is optional.</div>
    <div class="form-grid">
      <div class="full"><label>Event Name</label><input id="evName" placeholder="e.g. 100m Dash (Boys)"></div>
      <div><label>Day</label><select id="evDay"><option value="day1">Day 1</option><option value="day2">Day 2</option><option value="day3">Day 3</option></select></div>
      <div><label>Game Type</label><select id="evType" onchange="updateStudentLabels()"><option value="individual">Individual</option><option value="team">Team</option><option value="grouped">Grouped</option></select></div>
